WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:04.421 --> 00:00:06.464
What?

00:00:06.464 --> 00:00:10.010
Hi, and welcome to Circuit
Breakers on Apple TV+

00:00:10.010 --> 00:00:13.388
It's a science fiction
show in the spirit of Twilight Zone.

00:00:13.388 --> 00:00:15.724
So each episode is like a little mini movie.

00:00:16.391 --> 00:00:17.100
At its heart.

00:00:17.100 --> 00:00:20.770
It's about the trials and tribulations
that middle schoolers go through.

00:00:21.021 --> 00:00:24.482
You've got the most passion of anybody
out here, but sadly, not the height.

00:00:24.524 --> 00:00:26.443
Maybe you should try a sport
you're more suited to.

00:00:26.443 --> 00:00:27.235
Like?

00:00:28.236 --> 00:00:28.903
Bowling?

00:00:28.903 --> 00:00:31.322
With a bit of mystery, spookiness

00:00:31.322 --> 00:00:34.451
and of course, technology mixed in.

00:00:34.492 --> 00:00:36.828
Would you like learn more about this opportunity?

00:00:36.828 --> 00:00:39.330
Yes.

00:00:40.957 --> 00:00:45.003
My episode is about a walking robot,
basically taking over my life.

00:00:46.171 --> 00:00:50.383
I need you to pretend to be me
while I practice dance.  Sit at my desk,

00:00:50.383 --> 00:00:51.634
do the chores I hate...

00:00:51.634 --> 00:00:53.720
anything that just gives me more time.

00:00:53.970 --> 00:00:56.347
What was your plan if you got caught?
How would I get caught?

00:00:56.347 --> 00:00:57.807
It looks just like me.

00:00:57.807 --> 00:01:01.019
Yeah, but it isn't you.

00:01:02.854 --> 00:01:06.983
In my episode, there's a universal remote
that can control our parents.

00:01:07.192 --> 00:01:10.737
We have pizza and ice cream for dinner,
as requested.

00:01:10.904 --> 00:01:13.865
They accidentally pause their parents

00:01:14.032 --> 00:01:16.659
Pause. They're frozen? Oh No.

00:01:19.579 --> 00:01:20.955
What is going on?

00:01:20.955 --> 00:01:24.793
In my episode,
it's almost as if time stands still.

00:01:24.793 --> 00:01:27.170
Everybody's frozen like nobody's moving.

00:01:27.170 --> 00:01:30.131
It's all silent. And it's, like,
super weird and eerie and creepy.

00:01:30.131 --> 00:01:33.176
I conducted an experiment in time dilation.

00:01:33.301 --> 00:01:36.429
Now, how do you change things back?

00:01:39.432 --> 00:01:40.934
Welcome to memory therapy.

00:01:40.934 --> 00:01:42.143
This is the TS3.

00:01:42.143 --> 00:01:44.229
It lets you relive memories.

00:01:44.229 --> 00:01:46.189
I think I know how to get my parents back together.

00:01:46.189 --> 00:01:47.899
The pods are

00:01:47.899 --> 00:01:49.317
technically time machines.

00:01:49.317 --> 00:01:51.194
And next session I load and more happy memories.

00:01:51.194 --> 00:01:52.904
And they'll realize how much they love each other.

00:01:52.904 --> 00:01:53.530
You're dreaming.

00:01:53.530 --> 00:01:55.740
It's not that easy.

00:02:03.289 --> 00:02:05.625
I told you we shouldn't have done that.

00:02:05.625 --> 00:02:07.836
Something's wrong.

00:02:09.546 --> 00:02:14.259
These electrodes will allow thoughts
to be shared instantaneously.

00:02:14.259 --> 00:02:18.388
In my episode,
I volunteer to be in a science experiment,

00:02:18.388 --> 00:02:21.141
and my and the principal's bodies
end up swapping.

00:02:21.182 --> 00:02:25.895
My personality goes into the 13 year old boy's body and vice versa.

00:02:25.895 --> 00:02:27.105
I get his.

00:02:27.105 --> 00:02:29.649
Transfer completed.

00:02:29.774 --> 00:02:32.318
We just need the doctor
to put everything back to normal.

00:02:32.318 --> 00:02:34.028
Let's go then.

00:02:36.823 --> 00:02:37.907
We get introduced

00:02:37.907 --> 00:02:41.619
to these robots
that can code your DNA and alter it.

00:02:42.036 --> 00:02:44.080
I can be genetically altered

00:02:44.080 --> 00:02:46.875
and increase my natural physical strength.

00:02:46.958 --> 00:02:49.252
But these bots are very invasive.

00:02:49.335 --> 00:02:53.214
Do you know how many things are wrong
with that sentence?

00:02:54.674 --> 00:02:59.262
In this episode, we're on Mars,
taking experiments for the human race.

00:02:59.429 --> 00:03:00.763
It's important stuff, but

00:03:01.723 --> 00:03:02.932
I miss my friends

00:03:02.932 --> 00:03:05.018
There's like a whole sandstorm over my hub.

00:03:05.852 --> 00:03:08.396
You have to do whatever it takes

00:03:08.396 --> 00:03:10.148
for the greater good.

00:03:15.278 --> 00:03:17.530
We've lost communication with Earth.

00:03:18.406 --> 00:03:22.202
You get really attached to the characters
and what they're going through.

00:03:22.619 --> 00:03:24.746
This is not a show about flying cars.

00:03:24.746 --> 00:03:29.042
This is a show about conflict and emotion and adventure.

00:03:32.086 --> 00:03:34.797
Well, you still have to finish detention.

